                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_1",
                  "html": "<h2>Perfect for families</h2> <p><span>The perfect&nbsp;place for&nbsp;a family&nbsp;looking for a quiet rural escape on a working farm.&nbsp;</span><span>Step into the open-plan living room, with four-seater sofa and two tub chairs, a Smart TV and dining area, all overlooking the lovely green spaces around the farm buildings.</span></p>",
                  "sansHeadings": {
                    "h6": "700"
                  },
                  "hiddenOn": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": "2_5",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_2",
                  "html": "<h4>Features</h4> <ul> <li>Kitchen Dining Living Area&nbsp;</li> <li><span>Super king master with en-suite shower</span></li> <li> <div>over bath</div> <div></div> </li> <li> <div>Bed 2 King</div> </li> <li> <div>Bed 3 Twin</div> </li> <li> <div>Family shower room&nbsp;</div> <div></div> </li> <li> <div>Large enclosed patio&nbsp;</div> <div></div> </li> <li> <div>Pets accepted&nbsp;</div> </li> </ul>",
